          %h2#idea Idea
          %p
            The notion of a
            %em 2-sheaf
            is the generalization of the notion of a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/sheaf"} sheaf
            to the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/higher+category+theory"} higher category theory
            of
            = succeed "/" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/2-categories"} 2-categories
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/bicategories"} bicategories
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/2-topos"} 2-topos
          .num_remark
            %h6#remark_on_terminology Remark on terminology
            %p
              A
              %em 2-sheaf
              is a higher sheaf of
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/categories"} categories
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/groupoids"} groupoids
              = succeed "." do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%282%2C1%29-sheaf"} (2,1)-sheaf
              = succeed "," do
                %strong
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/stack"} stack
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/stack"} stack
              (in either flavor) is considered only over a
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/1-site"} 1-site
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%282%2C1%29-sheaves"} (2,1)-sheaves
              more generally over
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%282%2C1%29-sites"} (2,1)-sites
              and 2-sheaves over
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/2-sites"} 2-sites
            %p
              Therefore, saying “2-sheaf” serves to indicate the full generality of the notion of higher sheaves in
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/2-category+theory"} 2-category theory
          %h2#definition Definition
          %p
